297	 q:'A test script sends ADC:REFERENCE BANANA. Per the fixed code and probe_adc_reference_unvalidated, what is the device state afterwards?',
298	 snip:`<span class="cm"># scripts/audit_msp430.py — after 58b7e2d</span>
