440	 q:'After ADC:RESOLUTION 8, a 3.3-V injection is read with AVCC (3.3 V) selected. What code comes back, and what changed in the transfer function?',
441	 opts:[
442	  {t:'255 — full scale; FS becomes 2⁸−1 while the reference is unchanged',c:true, w:'Correct (this is the existing edge-case test). Resolution sets FS = (1 << 8) − 1 = 255; the reference still sets the voltage span. int(3.3/3.3 × 255) = 255. Reference and resolution are the two independent knobs of N = FS × Vin/VR+.'},
