444	  {t:'255 — but only because 3.3 V clips against a now-smaller reference',c:false,w:'The reference did not change — it is still 3.3 V. 255 is exact full scale (Vin = VR+), not a clip above it.'},
445	  {t:'SCPI error -224 — resolution must be set before the reference',c:false,w:'There is no ordering constraint between ADC:RESOLUTION and ADC:REFERENCE; both independently parameterise the next conversion.'},
