473	 q:'Spot the bug in this firmware under SIL test. The simulated MSP430 has ADC:REFERENCE VREF2.5 selected and 1.5 V injected. What does read_volts() return?',
474	 snip:`<span class="cm">/* firmware under test */</span>
475	<span class="kw">float</span> <span class="fn">read_volts</span>(<span class="kw">void</span>) {
