480	  {t:'≈1.98 V — raw is 2457 (encoded against 2.5 V) but decoded with 3.3; the constant must match the selected reference',c:true, w:'Correct. Simulator: int(1.5/2.5 × 4095) = 2457. Firmware: 2457/4095 × 3.3 = 1.98 V — off by the ratio 3.3/2.5. The fix: multiply by 2.5f (or better, by a constant tied to the reference-selection code). Before 58b7e2d this bug was invisible because the simulator also used 3.3.'},
